{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_windft_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_windft_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "老工廠裡的一支舞",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_windft_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d7f8297a3c217c336c53851f2b6475c7e2660bf4a29b39f54b749b1791813988",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周一"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸、媽，我回來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，您是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老甘特的兒子，就是你這小子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得還要我跑一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看你這眼睛一刻也離不開終端的樣子，這洗衣機交給你來修，衣服乾了也不一定能修好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是在等招聘邀請......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像你這樣的年輕人都想去外面，剩下我們一幫老東西在這裡，家裡東西壞了，又要花大價錢請外面的人再回來修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還好有我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，您的扳手掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別在那邊愣著了，過來搭把手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎，來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......撞到櫃子了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冒冒失失的，能做成什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎？小甘特回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老喬恩！那我家的門鎖就不用辛苦你跑一趟了，有空讓小甘特來就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你嫌我手不利索了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，就算它抖得像篩糠，我也能修好你那個舊鎖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎——這不減輕您負擔嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這小子的手藝我看不上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你等著，我忙完這個，還是我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬恩爺爺，修鎖我可以的，要不然還是——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老甘特的崽，我說，別看不上我們這群老東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......喬恩爺爺，我沒有啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您等下，我放下東西，就來幫您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周二"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小甘特，今天也來了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......畢竟答應了您來修東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "威廉叔，我想問一下，這裡放的這個......懸掛小玩具是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當年我老婆生了孩子，我們兩個人卻都忙著，沒時間陪孩子玩，只好在這裡用彈簧掛上一個小玩具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次我中途回來，拿東西，關上櫃門的時候，這個小玩意就能彈著彈著晃蕩很久，我的女兒就一直抓著它玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了讓它多晃蕩一會，我每次關門的力氣就會很大。時間久了，也養成習慣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在她都出去工作了，我這個習慣卻沒改過來......也好幾年都捨不得買車票出去看她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但看著這個小東西就和看到她一樣，嘿嘿，所以，只能每隔不久就找人來修修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍等一下，威廉叔，我在這裡再多上一點潤滑油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡也可以再加一個小小的減震裝置，它的使用壽命就能延長許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，說到底，還是我的老毛病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我和老婆留在這裡，也過得挺好，對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬恩爺爺，您的螺絲刀掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你質疑我原本的修改？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是這樣能用得更久一點，您也不用經常來修！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......眼睛倒靈光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還能看出來這些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我小的時候也去過工廠幫忙嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我偷偷地幹點活，爸媽拿的薪資就多一點，學費就能快點存夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是那條最大的流水線，您那時或許還見過我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你小時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......小子，你小時候，我這雙手可不是拿這些工具的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是，老喬恩之前——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（猛吸一口煙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“約翰老媽為您提供......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......是廣告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，我們現在在幹活，別愣神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_windows"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周三"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老喬恩，腿腳最近怎麼樣，手還痛得厲害嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，不好不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，你昨天表現得還行，今天上手修一個給我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這把鎖......都朽成這樣了，即便修好過不了多久還會再壞掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您怎麼不乾脆買把新的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你好幾年沒回來了，不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我媳婦去外面的移動城市打工了，她說她要賺一大筆錢，做出點事業再回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我留著這把舊鎖，等她回來那一天，她當年帶走的鑰匙仍舊能打開這扇門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要是換了鎖，她那麼遠，信使送信的花費高，寄東西花費更高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寄把鑰匙，不划算，再往多了寄......我在這裡，又有什麼可給她的？就算有，在郵費上花這麼大筆錢，她收到了只會罵我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就在這裡，踏踏實實地做我的活，好好幹就完了！總能幹出個明天的，對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過梅森叔，根據鑰匙，也是可以配鎖的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太貴啦，太貴啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做鎖芯難，會的人也少，就算找到人了，做鎖芯的價格......真有這點閒錢，我就存下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不太好修呢......我先看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小甘特你可是外面好大學畢業的，厲害著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好大學畢業......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（猛吸一口煙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家可是都有好前程！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（查看終端）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又分神了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——畢竟現在是招聘旺季，很多公司都在招人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可惜，總是壞結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別太擔心，你這樣的好小子，總會有好結果的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，你就這麼想去外面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學會新的，再帶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別忘了本就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，您的螺絲刀又掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_windows"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周四"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小甘特！這是真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你給我做了個新鎖芯，厲害啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......不難的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（默默抽煙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......人老了，比不上年輕人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄰居B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老喬恩，從您到我們這修東西的第一天起，我還是頭一次聽您說這種話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（默默抽煙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，你願不願意來幫我一個忙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家有架......舊鋼琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是架......好鋼琴啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但感覺，您已經很久沒有彈過它了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老工人打開琴蓋，灰塵散在空氣裡。\n被機油腐蝕到斑駁的手指按上琴鍵，鋼琴發出走調喑啞的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次好好地彈它，已經是幾十年以前的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個時候，我還坐在乾乾淨淨的寬敞屋子裡，下面坐滿了喜歡聽我彈琴的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人用發顫的手彈出一段音符。\n裡屋窸窸窣窣傳來布料摩擦的聲音，一個蒼老但充滿喜悅的嗓音開口：\n親愛的，我聽到了！你在彈鋼琴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "親愛的，我的瑪吉，你聽到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，快出來跳你最喜歡的舞吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "走調的音符在顫抖的手指下源源不斷地流出，依稀能聽出這是一支歡快的舞曲。\n老婦人的手提起裙擺，挽出好看的形狀，她踮起腳尖，跳起舞步。\n看不出是什麼舞種，也看不出任何學過的痕跡，但老人的眼中此刻流出蜜來，盯著他妻子的每一個小小的旋轉。\n小甘特下意識地屏住了呼吸，只是看著眼前這一幕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了治手，我後來找遍了醫生。然後我放棄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的手原來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子，這就和你好不容易去了外面找到了工作，結果上班第一天，你發現你腦子裡的知識全沒了，其他的還都記得一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你記得你付出的努力，你記得你的輝煌，你記得你的成就，可是什麼都沒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的手壞了，我沒法再按下琴鍵，也沒辦法，再看這架鋼琴哪怕一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得您是那個表情，在我說您說不定見過我小時候在工廠偷偷幹活的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸媽和我說過，大家其實都知道我在那裡偷偷做工，廠裡是不允許的，但大家都偷偷瞞下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們也幫我瞞下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒辦法繼續彈琴，簽約的公司來找我交違約金，我拿不出那麼多錢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰知道他們藏了那麼多條條款款，這幾乎是我一輩子往死裡彈琴才能賺到的數目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這裡，一次又一次地在倉庫各個角落裡躲過了那群人，然後，我遇到了瑪吉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她幫我找藏身的地方，偷偷拿飯給我，還告訴我外面的夕陽有多好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這架鋼琴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我前不久偷偷回去，從老倉庫裡把它翻出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為我不會再彈琴了，但瑪吉現在......耳朵出了問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我四處做工，接更多的活，就是想存下錢。瑪吉能聽到的最後這段日子，我希望我能找人修好這架鋼琴，每天彈給她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小子......孩子，我不是......故意排擠你。我前幾天說看不上你要自己來，只是怕，那點工錢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉......孩子，你能幫著我，修好這架鋼琴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怕我們等不起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我之前沒有接觸過樂器的修理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，要是太為難，也沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果一直執著於修好這架琴，我怕我們都會變成喬恩最開始的樣子。我和他說過很多次，現在，我們的現在才是最重要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便聽不見鋼琴聲，我的腦子也還記得這曲調。並不是天塌下來了，我們還有很多種方式可以活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我會學的，您放心，我會盡我最大的努力學的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛只是在想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是我，經歷了和您還有喬恩爺爺一樣的事情，我恐怕......做不到像您現在一樣去生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在發現手無法再彈鋼琴的那一刻，還有聽不見的那一刻，我可能就會放棄自己之前的生活目標了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很難想像自己要怎樣才能堅持下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但剛才的那幅場景......很震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小甘特看著面前兩位老人臉上由於激動沁出的一層薄薄汗珠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能有些冒犯，但是......如果一顆殘損的星星也能在夜空裡繼續放出光芒，我為什麼不能做到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周五"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調音可以讓我來，只是這些零件......有幾個弦槌已經不隨著琴鍵運動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看......應該是這邊杠杆軸架的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬恩爺爺，有彎嘴的鉗子嗎？我試試調整一下這裡的螺絲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給，新的彈簧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對——裝在這裡，這個......是叫弦槌嗎？它就能立馬彈回去——這是您要的效果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，我先......歇一歇，你稍等等，晚餐請留下來和我們一起吃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（瑪吉奶奶......最終還是會失去自己的聽力吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我們就算修好了鋼琴，又能維持多久呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "親愛的，我的瑪吉，你聽到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，快出來跳你最喜歡的舞吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（如果這個結果註定無法改變，我就算修好了鋼琴，對他們還是沒有什麼太大的幫助吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（要是能讓瑪吉奶奶看到鋼琴曲的話......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羽獸身上最輕軟的絨毛，不會影響到琴弦的發音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把外設裝置加在這裡，也不會影響到共鳴腔的音色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道他們喜不喜歡這樣的顏色，但瑪吉奶奶那天穿的裙子就是這種湖藍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到同樣的染料可真不是簡單事，我也不知道我的審美......嗯，不過羽毛和絲帶，應該不會有人不喜歡的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小甘特試探著按下幾個琴鍵，琴弦的振動通過一個精巧細緻的裝置傳到外層系著的羽毛和絲帶上，顫出好看的弧度。\n初升陽光從外面的窗戶漏進來，照在鋼琴上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這樣自作主張，他們會喜歡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周六"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要不要試試看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並沒有改變它任何原有的設置，如果不想要，這個外層裝置也可以很方便地拆除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，這是我昨晚突然的想法，自己也就這麼做了，沒有和您商量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（按下琴鍵）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，孩子......這很漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是特意把這些布帶的顏色也選成了湖藍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪吉的眼睛就是這個顏色......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（彈出一首曲子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天的工廠燈火通明♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像昨天傍晚我說愛你時的夕陽♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "親愛的，我能聽到，你在彈這首曲子......是我之前每天下工時都會唱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我走在工廠裡，你跟在我的後面，就像這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（跳起輕巧的步伐）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小甘特感覺自己似乎看到了幾十年前兩人的模樣。\n喬恩穿著禮服，瑪吉踏著舞步，琴鍵流淌出樂聲，裙擺在工廠中旋轉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......我是不是終於做成了一件事？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人換了一首精巧的曲子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你在想什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我在想......明天，要不要，我可以直接去工廠裡，我腦子裡想了很久的，那條流水線......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉，有點語無倫次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在想，我或許可以去工廠幫大家改造那條流水線——就是我爸爸媽媽一直以來工作的那條。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做過那個活，每天就坐在自己的位子上，盯著眼前那條傳輸帶，抬手，翻轉，放下，檢查品質是否合格——效率很低，而且很累人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想了很久了，我想改造它，就明天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是在等外面公司的招聘邀請嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你幫工廠改流水線，是要在這裡待著了嗎？工廠老闆那邊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，外面的公司我還在等，我還是想出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬恩爺爺，我很早之前就有改造這個工廠的想法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者說，這就是支撐我一直以來往上爬的根本想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我以為你們這群年輕人出去，只是想用自己更靈光的腦子賺更多錢，出去以後，誰還會在乎這裡這幫老東西的死活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你和很多人都不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬恩爺爺，我也沒什麼不一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人停下了彈琴的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想賺很多錢，我想往上走，去最好的公司，這就是我最想做的事，我也怨恨搶走我機會的人，我就是這樣一個普通的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......在修鎖的時候，梅森叔說他不換鎖的原因，是為了讓妻子回來時還能用自己帶走的鑰匙打開家門。我聽過很多類似的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“爸爸已經吃過了，你和媽媽吃就好。”“媽媽這條褲子沒穿幾年，它現在還很時髦呀。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，我們都只是沒有選擇，只好這樣說，讓自己覺得好受一點罷了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一開始的想法，不過是學會一點技術，讓工廠裡的流水線輕鬆些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我的爸媽輕鬆些，我們能賺更多的錢，就可以不用繼續住在小屋子裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你現在還能記著這些，就已經就很不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我突然覺得，難道就因為我現在沒能收到外面公司的錄用通知，我就要否定自己一直以來做成的事，不去幫助大家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（默默吸煙）孩子，想岔了是一件很正常的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒有瑪吉，我可能早就在某個地方一個人死去了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我太執著於這個目標的中間階段了，所以前幾天回來的時候，一直是......那個樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明很簡單的問題，我卻把自己困住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小甘特自嘲地笑笑，但眼睛閃閃發光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但或許我改完那幾條流水線，威廉叔就能有錢買車票去看自己的女兒，梅森叔就有底氣給他在外面的妻子寄去新的鑰匙和更多的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小甘特呼出了一口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬恩爺爺，這幾天我可能不能跟著您一起修東西了，但一旦工廠那邊的事結束，我就會再來找您的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_006",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪吉聽不清二人在說些什麼，她正趴在窗台看夕陽，直到老喬恩再次彈起鋼琴，她快活地轉過了頭。\n她上前拉起小甘特的雙手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，別在一旁站著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧，趁我還能聽到這鋼琴聲，趁我這把老骨頭還能跳起來，趁現在夕陽正好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪吉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不來一起跳支舞呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_u"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天的工廠燈火通明♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像昨天傍晚我說愛你時的夕陽♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀嘀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的終端怎麼落在家裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十五條未讀消息，全是廣告......上次查看消息時間......三天前？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我有這麼久沒有看終端上的消息了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天上的星星好亮啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小甘特",
      "speakerId": "avg_433_windft_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天我又要去修些什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小甘特躺在床上，一整天的維修讓他胳膊酸痛。\n他看著天花板，上面的牆皮斑駁脫落。\n他閉上眼睛，很快就進入了睡眠。\n夢裡，在幾年後，他接手了工廠，所有人都穿上了乾淨的制服，戴上了宣傳圖紙裡畫著的那種結實的防護帽，住在溫暖寬敞的房屋裡。\n他滿足地翻了一個身，一揮手，打落了放在床邊的藥瓶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "終端",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
